{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/swift\/never\/defaultlaunchbehavior(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultLaunchBehavior"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"behavior"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV","text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This behavior can be used to define if a scene is shown on application"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"launch in the absence of any previously saved state."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On platforms that do not support multiple windows, this value is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On platforms other than Windows, there must be at least one scene that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presents itself. If no scenes are defined to present, the first scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will be presented, regardless of the value provided to this modifier."}]},{"name":"Note","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"During app launch, on platforms other than Windows, the system"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will only consider scenes whose role matches the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doc:\/\/com.apple.documentation\/documentation\/bundleresources\/information_property_list\/uiapplicationpreferreddefaultscenesessionrole"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"key in the application scene manifest of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Info.plist"},{"type":"text","text":" file."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For instance, a volumetric window would need the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"UIWindowSceneSessionRoleVolumetricApplication"},{"type":"text","text":" role."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On Windows, this behavior will also be used to determine which scene is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presented when clicking on the icon of a running application with no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"visible windows."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"On visionOS, the system may background the last dismissed scene instead"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of closing it. Thus, the suppressed behavior additionally specifies that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the scene should not be presented when tapping on the application icon"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with no visible windows."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For example, you may wish to present a welcome window on launch of your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"app when there are no previous document windows being restored:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        DocumentGroup(newDocument: MyDocument()) { configuration in","            DocumentEditor(configuration.$document)","        }","","        Window(\"Welcome to My App\", id: \"welcome\") {","            WelcomeView()","        }","        .defaultLaunchBehavior(.presented)","    }","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The default value for all scenes if you do not apply this modifier is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/SceneLaunchBehavior\/automatic","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". With that strategy, a scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will only present itself if it is the first scene defined by the app,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and no other scenes have presented themselves."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"metadata":{"symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"defaultLaunchBehavior","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI19SceneLaunchBehaviorV","text":"SceneLaunchBehavior","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE21defaultLaunchBehavioryQrAA0dfG0VF::SYNTHESIZED::s:s5NeverO","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"defaultLaunchBehavior(_:)","role":"symbol"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Swift\/Never"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets the default 